1. Permissions

You may download, use, and share unmodified copies of AdVanish.

When sharing AdVanish, you must preserve the original copyright,
license, and attribution notices.

You may not claim that you created, developed, or contributed to
AdVanish unless you actually did so.

You may not misrepresent the origin of AdVanish, take credit for
someone else's work, or present yourself as an official developer
or maintainer without authorization.

You may fork AdVanish solely to rebuild it for your own use.
If your fork is only intended for rebuilding AdVanish, you may
not modify, remove, replace, or add anything to the source code.

You may compile and rebuild the original, unmodified source code
without requesting additional permission.

Modifications are only permitted when contributing through the
process described in Section 2, or with prior written permission
from maxblox2999.

2. Contributions

If you want to contribute to AdVanish, you may create a fork of
the official repository for the purpose of proposing improvements.

You may add features, fix bugs, improve existing functionality,
and make other changes within your contribution fork.

Once your changes are ready, submit a pull request to the official
AdVanish repository.

maxblox2999 will review the proposed changes and decide whether
to approve, reject, or request further improvements.

If your changes work correctly and are considered beneficial to
the project, they may be merged into the main repository.

Submitting a contribution does not guarantee approval or acceptance.

If your contribution is rejected, you are requested to remove
your fork unless you have received permission to maintain it.

This removal request is voluntary and does not override any
applicable third-party license rights.

Contribution forks may not be used to publish unofficial releases,
distribute modified builds, or misrepresent the project as an
official AdVanish release.

All contribution forks must retain the original copyright,
license, and attribution notices.

By submitting a contribution, you grant maxblox2999 a perpetual,
worldwide, non-exclusive, royalty-free license to use, modify,
reproduce, distribute, and incorporate your submitted contribution
into AdVanish, including future versions of the project.

Ownership of contributed code remains with its respective author.

